# Math Level Core Rules

- Every new level must include `explore`, `practice`, and `challenge`.
- `practice` count must be 3-6 questions.
- `challenge` count must be 1-2 questions.
- Every question must provide a `hint`.
- Hints are hidden by default and shown only after clicking `💡`.
- Exploration content and practice/challenge content must not be near-duplicate.
- Keep wording child-friendly and concise.
- Ensure the 6-level cadence includes at least 1 hard level.

# Delivery Requirements

- Add/update the level file.
- Add/update entry in `index.html`.
- Provide a short self-check against all rules above.
